DMX2Percent Calculator allows you to easily calculate the correct value for:
- DMX 8-bit to percent;  
- DMX 16-bit to percent; 
 - percent to DMX 8-bit; 
 - percent to DMX 16-bit; 
 - DMX 8-bit to DMX 16-bit;  
- DMX 16-bit to DMX 8-bit.

This applications is addressed to the MA Lighting grandMA operators. They know how much time you need to correct or create fixture on grandMA.
With this calculator you will no longer waste your time on tedios calculations.
Just type one value and the calculator will give you the rest of the figures.
